Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:25:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(errors): the rate-limit header readers live in
 agent_runtime_helpers_ratelimit

agent_runtime_helpers.py is over the 2000-line target and may only shrink, so
the reset-time readers (_set_reset_from_retry_after, the vendor reset headers
and their duration parser) move with the new ratelimit_headers into a topical
sibling, and agent_runtime_helpers imports them back. Nothing else changes.

ratelimit_headers no longer catches every exception to cope with a value that
is not a mapping: it reads items() when the headers have it and returns
nothing otherwise.
